/p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:15px;\"><span class=\"color_13 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">PROTOCOL</span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:15px;\"><span class=\"color_13 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">PRESENTACI&Oacute; DE PRODUCTES</span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:15px;\"><span class=\"color_13 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">PROMOTORS I DEGUSTACIONS</span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:15px;\"><span class=\"color_13 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">REPARTIMENT DE PUBLICITAT</span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:15px;\"><span class=\"color_13 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">PUBLICITAT</span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:15px;\"><span class=\"color_13 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">CASTINGS TV</span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:15px;\"><span class=\"color_13 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">PASSARELA I SHOWROOM&#39;S</span></span></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:15px;\"><span class=\"color_13 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-size:15px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">CAT&Agrave;LEGS DE MODA ...</span></span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>","skin":"WRichTextNewSkin","isQaMode":false,"fullNameCompType":"wysiwyg.viewer.components.WRichText"}}}},"nicknameToCompIdMaps":{}}